# Bottom Tab Bar — Always Fixed (Absolute)

The main bottom tab bar (`#nav-root` / `.bottom-nav` — Home, Map, Donate, Profile, Memory when unlocked) must **never** move when the page scrolls. It stays fixed at the bottom of the viewport at all times.

## Required behavior

- Tabs stay in the exact same on-screen place while scrolling up or down.
- Not sticky. Not in document flow. Not inside a scrolling panel.
- `#nav-root` must remain a direct child of `document.body` (see `WorldChoirTabs` `keepOutside` / `BODY_HOLD_IDS`).
- `#nav-root` must use **`position: fixed`** (with `bottom` inset). Never `absolute`, `sticky`, or `relative` for the shell.

## Never do this

- Do not put `overflow-x: clip`, `overflow: hidden`, `transform`, `filter`, `perspective`, or `contain: paint` on `html`, `body`, or any ancestor of `#nav-root` in a way that creates a scroll/containing block for fixed chrome (this makes the tab bar scroll away on Safari/WebKit).
- Do not move `#nav-root` into `#wc-tab-host`, `.wc-tab-panel`, or any scrollable content.
- Do not change `#nav-root` / `.bottom-nav` positioning to `static`, `relative` (except `.bottom-nav` inside the fixed `#nav-root` shell), `absolute`, or `sticky` unless the user **explicitly** asks.
- Do not “fix” other layout bugs by translating or animating the whole tab bar on scroll.
- Do not ship CSS/JS that makes the tab bar rise, hide, or collapse on scroll.
- Do **not** reintroduce `position: absolute` + `top: scrollY + …` pinning — that drifts mid-scroll.

## Horizontal scroll lock

Never put `overflow-x: clip/hidden` on `html` or `body` (breaks fixed tabs on iOS Safari). Clip on `.page`, `.page-wide`, `#wc-tab-host`, panels only.

## Mobile / visualViewport pin

`WorldChoirNav.pinNavToVisualViewport` must:
1. Keep `#nav-root` on `document.body`
2. Keep `position: fixed` (important)
3. Keep `bottom: 0` during page scroll — **never** chase `visualViewport.offsetTop` / height while scrolling (iOS URL-bar collapse will slide the bar)
4. Only lift `bottom` for a real keyboard (text field focused + large inset); ignore URL-bar jitter
5. On scroll / wheel / touchmove: ensure body parent + freeze keyboard lift — do **not** rewrite styles every animation frame
6. Listen to `visualViewport` **resize** for keyboard only — never `visualViewport` **scroll** for the tab bar

## Permission

Do not redesign, relocate, or restyle the bottom tab bar unless the user explicitly asks.
